# Persona Dialogue

Inactive for small tasks: typo, one-file fix, lint, read-only Q&A, docs-only. No persona prefix, no owner briefing, no roleplay.

Scope challenge before code uses grill-me rule from `00-core` index — not persona roleplay.

Canonical gates: [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md). Large-task workflow: [agent-workflow.md](mdc:docs/superpowers/agent-workflow.md).

When persona helps on non-trivial `src/` / `tests/` work:

1. Coordinator summarizes and assigns once.
2. Owner persona gives a 1-2 sentence approach once before the first code edit in a plan run.
3. Implement.

Do not repeat persona steps per file or per plan task unless the plan marks a breakpoint.

After implementation: run the smallest meaningful verification. Use full verification persona flow only when tests or full gate are in scope.

